--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 2e0ce3e543780b04dba488492949ce28, type: 3}
  m_Name: Day1_Intro
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueSO
  lineArray:
  - speaker: 1
    text: Good morning!
    playerEmote: 0
    npcEmote: 5
    isShaking: 0
    isNpcGlaring: 0
    focusNpcSO: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: 1
    text: You must be the one who works this field. I've got an offer for you.
    playerEmote: 0
    npcEmote: 0
    isShaking: 0
    isNpcGlaring: 1
    focusNpcSO: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: 0
    text: An offer?
    playerEmote: 0
    npcEmote: 0
    isShaking: 0
    isNpcGlaring: 0
    focusNpcSO: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: 1
    text: I am a Distributor of ICAN, International Company of Agriculture and Nature. A company dedicated to helping struggling farmers.
    playerEmote: 0
    npcEmote: 0
    isShaking: 0
    isNpcGlaring: 1
    focusNpcSO: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: 1
    text: 'We''ve heard this village has been through difficult crop failures, as such I''ve come here to offer you a seed fabricator. '
    playerEmote: 0
    npcEmote: 1
    isShaking: 0
    isNpcGlaring: 0
    focusNpcSO: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: 1
    text: The seed fabricator can modify your crops into fast growing, pest resistant seeds.
    playerEmote: 0
    npcEmote: 0
    isShaking: 0
    isNpcGlaring: 0
    focusNpcSO: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: 0
    text: That sounds expensive. How much does it cost?
    playerEmote: 4
    npcEmote: 0
    isShaking: 0
    isNpcGlaring: 0
    focusNpcSO: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: 1
    text: Nothing. Not a coin. The only thing we ask is for you to sell your modified crops exclusively to us.
    playerEmote: 0
    npcEmote: 14
    isShaking: 0
    isNpcGlaring: 1
    focusNpcSO: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: 1
    text: Put seeds in, and powerful engineered seeds comes out. on top of that, ICAN will buy directly from you at a fair price.
    playerEmote: 0
    npcEmote: 0
    isShaking: 0
    isNpcGlaring: 0
    focusNpcSO: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: 0
    text: That sounds amazing! Why would you give this away for free?
    playerEmote: 0
    npcEmote: 0
    isShaking: 0
    isNpcGlaring: 0
    focusNpcSO: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: 1
    text: Because we at ICAN values hard working farmers like you and we know the recent harvest failures hasn't been kind.
    playerEmote: 0
    npcEmote: 0
    isShaking: 0
    isNpcGlaring: 1
    focusNpcSO: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: 1
    text: But that's not relevant. what is relevant, is how we are going to fix your situation now.
    playerEmote: 0
    npcEmote: 0
    isShaking: 0
    isNpcGlaring: 1
    focusNpcSO: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: 1
    text: Let's try it together. Bring me three plants from your field.
    playerEmote: 0
    npcEmote: 0
    isShaking: 0
    isNpcGlaring: 1
    focusNpcSO: {fileID: 0}
  reward:
    itemDataSO: {fileID: 0}
    amount: 0
  rewardDay: 0
